# Fikr form fields (register style)

Source of truth: `/students/register` field + label only. Do not restyle headers, cards, buttons, grids, or dialog chrome.

## Fields

Use `fk-field` (or `reg-input` / `fk-input` — they share the same tokens) on every `<input>`, `<select>`, and `<textarea>`:

- White fill, `rounded-lg`, `border-gray-200`
- `px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-gray-900`
- Focus: `border-primary-400` + `ring-2 ring-primary-500/20`
- Do **not** use filled gray fields (`bg-fikr-surface-low`, `border-0`) or purple/indigo/blue focus rings

## Labels

```
mb-1.5 block text-xs font-medium text-gray-600
```

Or `fk-flabel` / `fk-label` (same size and color). Do not use bold 13px ink labels.

## Do not

- Do not change modal/page headers, footers, buttons, grids, or card chrome when only updating fields
- Do not restyle chat composers, live video rooms, login, or print views
- Do not flatten the register wizard
